// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO4/13/14/21/26/27/39 - dedicated onboard
// ADS1292 ECG and AFE4490 PPG/pulse-oximeter sensor chip pins (see
// vendor pins_arduino.h). PUSH_BUTTON/SLIDE_SWITCH stay kept.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO15 tagged "led_low" - confirmed vendor firmware (Healthypiv4_Arduino.ino: digitalWrite(A13/GPIO15, LOW) commented "turn the LED on"; matches LED_BUILTIN alias in pins_arduino.h).
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO12 tagged "led_high" - confirmed vendor firmware (Healthypiv4_Arduino.ino: A15/GPIO12 soft_AP_mode_indication() and OTA_update_indication() blink patterns show HIGH=on, LOW=off).
// 2026-07-14 RE-CONFIRMED via a fresh independent fetch of
