// this session - exact match for GPIO12/15 LED code and GPIO4/13/14/21/
// 26/27/39 ADS1292/AFE4490 pins. See notes.txt.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO17 (PUSH_BUTTON/KEY_BUILTIN) and GPIO16 (SLIDE_SWITCH) NOT tagged - both excluded from chipGpios at the base ESP32 chip level (PSRAM-reserved pins 16-17, see esp32/esp32/board.json), so no capability entry exists to tag, despite vendor firmware confirming button (INPUT_PULLUP/FALLING) and slide-switch (INPUT_PULLUP/CHANGE) use.
